%%begintext align
%% The two men take hands and fall back, the two we. do the same at the same time, and change places,
%% which makes the men improper; then take hands and fall back as before, and change into their own sides,
%% which makes the men proper as at first :| The two men back to back, the two we. do the same at the
%% same time, all four turn S. then right and left with your Partners, till the 1. cu. come into the 2. cu. place.
%% [DMDfD]
